projects=intro('01 / SELECTED WORK','Currently building.<br><em>Eventually, evidence.</em>','This is where the projects will live: something to explore, something to download, and enough explanation to know what you’re looking at.')+'''<section class="empty-projects"><div class="empty-grid" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><p class="eyebrow">WORK IN PROGRESS</p><h2>The code is getting there.<br>The case studies will follow.</h2><p>My main projects are still in development. I’ll add demos, source or downloadable files, and write-ups here as they’re ready.</p><a class="text-link" href="/ideas/">See the questions behind the work ↗</a></section><div class="project-format"><span>01 &nbsp; Explore the build</span><span>02 &nbsp; Read the decisions</span><span>03 &nbsp; Download the work</span></div>'''
